{"v3_49923618d88b1b1a822bc406":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"小津ジャーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobdCMQFr.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小津玲奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルミート＆グリート\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐハロウィン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということでコスプレをしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのコスプレだと思いますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！まさか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オズの魔法使い？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「オヅ」の魔法使いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔女になりました🧙‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobIVnLfK.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前が小津だからという\nなんともわかりやすい理由で\nコスプレを決めたのですが\nたくさんの方に笑って頂けてうれしかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう一つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だんだんと\n肌寒くなってきて\nもう秋か〜なんて言っておりますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ気持ちは熱く夏でいたい！\nということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣を着ました👘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobnEyEQp.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は\n初めて全国ツアーに参加させていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な思い出がぎゅっと詰まった夏でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また来年もみなさんと一緒に\n楽しめるといいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！そして\n浴衣を着おさめたからには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう秋です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/21夜19時〜\nくりぃむクイズ　ミラクルナイン\nトラベルQ紅葉2時間SP！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきます🍁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な紅葉スポットや\n新たな秋の魅力を知ることができる\nクイズとなっています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ一緒にクイズを楽しんでいただけたら\n嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４３枚目シングル\n私は今回もアンダーメンバーとして\n活動させていただきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前作４２枚目シングル期間\n初めてアンダーライブに参加させて頂きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩方、同期、スタッフのみなさん\nファンの皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにたくさん支えていただいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":